#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3458
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Another Mosaic window already has \"%s\" open. Opening it here too could let "
"the two windows overwrite each other's work.\n"
"\n"
"You can open it read-only to look at it -- saving will ask for a new file."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka \"%s\" već je otvorena u drugom prozoru Mosaica. Ako je otvorite i "
"ovdje, prozori bi mogli međusobno prepisati rad.\n"
"\n"
"Možete je otvoriti samo za čitanje kako biste je pregledali — pri spremanju "
"ćete morati odabrati novu datoteku."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3465
msgid "This document is already open in another Mosaic window"
msgstr "Ovaj dokument već je otvoren u drugom prozoru Mosaica"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3466
msgid "Open read-only"
msgstr "Otvori samo za čitanje"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3508
#, c-format
msgid ", and %zu area(s) could not be read"
msgstr ", a %zu područja nije bilo moguće pročitati"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3511
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The file's structure was destroyed. Mosaic rebuilt the document from the "
"pieces it could find -- %zu layer(s) recovered%s. The file's index and its "
"save history are gone, so what you see may be older than the last save.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is written to your file until you save. Saving a copy now protects "
"what was found."
msgstr ""
"Struktura datoteke je uništena. Mosaic je sastavio dokument od dijelova koje "
"je uspio pronaći — obnovljeno slojeva: %zu%s. Indeks datoteke i njezina "
"povijest spremanja su izgubljeni, pa ono što vidite može biti starije od "
"zadnjeg spremanja.\n"
"\n"
"U vašu datoteku ne upisuje se ništa dok ne spremite. Spremanje kopije sada "
"čuva ono što je pronađeno."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3518
msgid "This file is badly damaged"
msgstr "Ova datoteka teško je oštećena"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3527
msgid "Two programs saved into this file"
msgstr "Dva programa spremala su u ovu datoteku"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3528
msgid ""
"This file holds two separate save histories -- it was open and saved in two "
"places at once. Both survived intact.\n"
"\n"
"Mosaic will open the version that was saved first. To keep the second one "
"too, save it as its own file now -- a later save may discard it."
msgstr ""
"Ova datoteka sadrži dvije zasebne povijesti spremanja — bila je otvorena i "
"spremana na dva mjesta istovremeno. Obje su ostale netaknute.\n"
"\n"
"Mosaic će otvoriti verziju koja je spremljena prva. Želite li zadržati i "
"drugu, spremite je sada kao zasebnu datoteku — kasnije spremanje moglo bi je "
"odbaciti."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3532
msgid "Save other version as..."
msgstr "Spremi drugu verziju kao..."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3553
msgid "Could not rebuild the other version"
msgstr "Drugu verziju nije bilo moguće obnoviti"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3567
msgid " Part of the record was destroyed, so this list may be incomplete."
msgstr " Dio zapisa je uništen pa ovaj popis možda nije potpun."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3570
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Part of \"%s\" can't be read.\n"
"\n"
"Mosaic can open it as it was at the last complete save, or open the "
"recovered version: %llu newer save(s) came back, and %zu area(s) that "
"couldn't be read show older content instead.%s%s\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is written to your file until you save."
msgstr ""
"Dio datoteke \"%s\" nije moguće pročitati.\n"
"\n"
"Mosaic je može otvoriti u stanju zadnjeg potpunog spremanja ili otvoriti "
"obnovljenu verziju: vratilo se %llu novijih spremanja, a %zu područja koja "
"nije bilo moguće pročitati prikazuju stariji sadržaj.%s%s\n"
"\n"
"U vašu datoteku ne upisuje se ništa dok ne spremite."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3578 src/ui/app_window.cpp:3619
msgid "This file is damaged"
msgstr "Ova datoteka je oštećena"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3579
msgid "Open last complete save"
msgstr "Otvori zadnje potpuno spremanje"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3579
msgid "Open recovered version"
msgstr "Otvori obnovljenu verziju"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3590
msgid "Could not open the recovered version"
msgstr "Obnovljenu verziju nije bilo moguće otvoriti"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3599
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"%s\" ends in an unfinished save -- whatever was writing it stopped "
"partway. The unfinished part was set aside; this file opens at the last "
"complete save."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka \"%s\" završava nedovršenim spremanjem — ono što ju je zapisivalo "
"zaustavilo se na pola. Nedovršeni dio je odložen; ova datoteka otvara se na "
"zadnjem potpunom spremanju."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3604
msgid "The last save didn't finish"
msgstr "Zadnje spremanje nije dovršeno"

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3612
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%zu areas of \"%s\" can't be read, even after repair. Where an earlier "
"version survived in the file's history it is shown in its place; anything "
"else is left blank.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is written to your file until you save. Saving a copy now protects "
"everything that remains."
msgstr ""
"%zu područja datoteke \"%s\" nije moguće pročitati ni nakon popravka. Ondje "
"gdje je u povijesti datoteke preživjela ranija verzija, prikazana je ona; "
"sve ostalo ostaje prazno.\n"
"\n"
"U vašu datoteku ne upisuje se ništa dok ne spremite. Spremanje kopije sada "
"čuva sve što je preostalo."

#: src/ui/app_window.cpp:3657
